[2026-08-21 03:47:59] [cot:thought] draws on DC capacity maps, announced campuses, power interconnect queues, and CBRE/JLL reports. The $858B gross Big-5 perimeter yields roughly $498B for the United States, $168B for Europe, $140B for Asia-Pacific, $36B for the Middle East and Africa, $18B for Latin America, and $18B for residual regions.
