[2026-08-21 03:47:59] [cot:thought] into states and metros. Northern Virginia leads at roughly 18% of US AI capex. Texas follows at about 12%. The Midwest rises with power availability.
[2026-08-21 03:47:59] [cot:thought] The Pacific Northwest, Southwest, and Carolinas round out the list. A scenario comparison
[2026-08-21 03:47:59] [cot:thought] will contrast global infrastructure spend against pure hyperscaler capex. Five charts
[2026-08-21 03:47:59] [cot:thought] are planned. A regional share bar and pie chart. A US metro and state ladder. A stacked area or bar chart by region over time. A scatter plot linking spend share to power queue or capacity risk. A scenario comparison by region.
